{"id":"en_the-beast-king-worships-the-worthless","title":"The Beast King Worships the Worthless","titleEn":"The Beast King Worships the Worthless","description":"For three years, Wren Calloway devoted herself to Dorian, a siren heir without a voice. Yet he dismisses her as a worthless null and severs their bond, doing so to shield her sister, Celeste. What Dorian never realized is that Wren was far from worthless: her devouring aura had long been suppressed, while Celeste's brilliance had actually been stolen from her. As a substitute bond-partner, Wren receives an unwanted white lion named Kane—once the kitten she cherished, now a beast king commanding the rift monsters. When Wren reclaims all that was taken from her, Dorian discovers too late that he had merely been containing Kane's light.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-beast-king-worships-the-worthless/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-beast-king-worships-the-worthless/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Revenge","Werewolf","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7csm3k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-beast-king-worships-the-worthless_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7csm3k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-beast-king-worships-the-worthless_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7csm3k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-beast-king-worships-the-worthless_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7csm3k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadabl